<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q2 sales, exports.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q2 sales, exports.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its domestic and export sales for the second quarter of the year. Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item		    Q2 1997	 Pct change from yr ago</p>
<p>  Total			 8,914		     10.6</p>
<p>  Domestic Sales*	   6,252		     20.8</p>
<p>    Oil Products	    5,364		     25.3</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		 375		     -4.7</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals	    513			2.2</p>
<p>  Export Sales		2,662		     -7.6</p>
<p>    Crude Oil		 2,489		     -5.0</p>
<p>    Oil Products		 38		    -66.3</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		  10		    -25.8</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals	    125		     -7.7</p>
<p>Legend: Statement is unaudited, * gross sales at consumer prices, includes indirect taxes</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7903. E-mail at timna.tanners@reuters.com)).</p>
</text>
